	(text "Output shrouds: 16-pin IDC to the output boards. Pin 1 is the triangle on the shroud.\nOdd pins 1-11 GND, 13 = +3V3 (shifter VCCA), 15 = +5V (shifter VCCB); data 1-8 on even pins 2-16\n(same as led-output-board J2 and MegaTree docs/power.md). 33R series resistors at the RP2350 end."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
